[VIMUME Talent OS — USER MANUAL EXPORT FORMAT SCHEMA]
This file contains the configuration structure for the binary DOCX generation pipeline.
In production, the node-docx or docx-templates library compiles this schema along with standard branding headers.

LAYOUT DESIGN SPECIFICATION:
- Page Margins: 2.5cm all around.
- Primary Typography: Outfit (Heading 1-3: Black/Gold bold, body: Charcoal/Dark gray).
- Header Branding: Productora EAR & VIMUME Talent OS official watermark.
- Sub-Tables layout: Structured tables for artist releases, contract clauses, and tour timetables.
